Package: toOrdinal
Version: 1.5-0.0
Date: 2026-10-31
Title: Cardinal to Ordinal Number & Date Conversion
Description: Converts cardinal numbers to ordinal numbers (for example 1 to 1st) using language specific rules for Dutch, English, French, German, Spanish, Swedish and Turkish, converts calendar dates to a long form with an ordinal day (October 9th, 2017), and converts Turkish numbers to ordinal words.
